          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/25/01/020" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">25.01.020  Scope - Oregon Plumbing Specialty Code.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-prefix-note field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p>(Amended by Ordinance 192117, effective November 21, 2025.)</p></div></div>



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>This Title applies to all plumbing done within the City, except sewer facilities installed by the City Engineer through contract or by City work force in any public place or right of way for the disposal of sanitary or storm drainage and water supply facilities installed by the Water Engineer through contract or City work force in any public place or right of way for supplying the water service.</span><br><span>Except as otherwise provided in this code, the Oregon Plumbing Specialty Code (OPSC) as adopted by OAR 918-750-0110 and amended by 918-750-0115, is adopted by this reference.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-6374b1983027dcf70821d7a9c25d812265824be7eb35a0adf2241bd4e0c62bf1">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
