<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/25/09/060" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">25.09.060  Participation of Portland Permitting &amp; Development in Appeals.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>Appeals of BES requirements pertaining to nonconforming sewers will be processed in conjunction with the Portland Permitting &amp; Development Administrative Appeal Board.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
